 <header class='page-heading'><span class='section-label'>Website information</span><h1>Using nrth.group.</h1><p>The public introduction to NRTH Inc. and its venture directions.</p></header>
 <article class='legal-prose'><h2>Understand the introduction.</h2><p>The portfolio presents areas of interest, research and potential work. A venture page does not establish that a product, service, integration or feature is available. Confirm the current position directly with NRTH.</p><h2>Separate opportunities, separate terms.</h2><p>Product access, service agreements, partnerships and investment arrangements require their own scope, information and applicable terms. This website is a starting point for those conversations.</p><h2>Read perspectives in context.</h2><p>Journal writing and visual studies provide general perspectives. They are not medical advice, chemical safety instructions, financial advice or guidance for a particular professional situation. Conceptual artwork is illustrative and is not evidence of NRTH facilities or product performance.</p><h2>Respect the identity and the site.</h2><p>Use the site lawfully and do not interfere with its operation. Preserve the proportions of the supplied NRTH wordmark. Do not use the identity or website materials to suggest an endorsement of an unrelated offering.</p><h2>Know when you leave.</h2><p>An email application or an external destination operates separately from nrth.group. Its own terms and privacy information apply to that service.</p><h2>Start with a question.</h2><p>Visit <a href='/contact'>Contact NRTH</a> for a question about the portfolio or this website.</p></article>
